    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277544</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>眠れないのかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Can't sleep?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277608</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、うん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277708</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう言えば、
僕の話を聞きたいって
言ってたよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come to think of it,
you said you had some
things to ask me, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277776</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ……だった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah... I did, yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277864</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたち、
ダオスに襲われたんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We were attacked
by Dhaos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278060</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ダオスに？
また時空を越えて……
いや、そんなまさか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By Dhaos? Did he jump
through time again...?
But there's no way he...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278060</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それにしても、どうして
ダオスに襲われるんだ。
君たちみたいな子どもが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, whatever the case,
why would he attack you?
You're still just children.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔王が人間襲うのに
理由なんてねんだろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A Demon King doesn't
need any reason to
attack humans, does he?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278220</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『魔王』か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Demon King," huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278372</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>読んだ本には、
そう書いてあったぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's what was
written in the
books I've read.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278372</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;さんたちは
『魔王』を倒した
『英雄』だって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Cless&gt; and his friends
were the "Heroes" who
defeated the "Demon King."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>確かに彼は
多くの人の命を奪った</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, he definitely took
a lot of people's lives.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『魔王』と呼ばれても
仕方がないのかもしれない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And in light of that, perhaps it
was only natural for people to
think of him as the "Demon King."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、それは
魔科学を排除する
ためだったんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But his actual goal was the
elimination of all magitech.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278668</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔科学って
前に聞いたよな！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Magitech"! We've heard of
that before, haven't we!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278756</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>世界のことわりを
破壊するって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Destroys the natural
order of the world"...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278844</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だから、ダオスは、
魔科学を……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so, Dhaos
was trying to...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279020</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ダオスは人間に魔科学を
やめるように言った</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dhaos told humanity to
stop using magitech.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279020</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それでもその利便性を
追求する人間たちは、
魔科学をやめなかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But it was extremely
useful, so humans
wouldn't give it up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279108</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だから、ダオスは
人々を襲った……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So that's why he
started attacking people...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279352</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>未だその真実は
語られないままだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's the truth, but no
one really talks about
it. So far, at least.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279352</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>君たちがそのことを
知らないように</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So that's why you
wouldn't know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279352</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>自分たちがおかした罪の重さに
誰も向き合うことができないまま、
世界は前に進んでいっている</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No one wants to face the weight
of their own sins, and yet the
world keeps going, all the same.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたし、魔術を
暴走させてしまったんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I caused some magic
to go out of control.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それがもしかしたら、
マナをたくさん使ってて、
それでダオスがわたしを……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe it's used up too much
mana, and that's why Dhaos...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279620</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、あれは
わざとと違うだろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that wasn't on
purpose, was it!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279720</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わざとじゃなくても
魔術使ったのは、
わたしだもん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even if I didn't mean to
do it, I'm still the one
who used the magic.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279852</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……なるほどね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ah, I see.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279852</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、君は
ダオスのされるがまま
なのかい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, then. Will you
just let Dhaos do
what he wants?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279968</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……他に罪を償う方法が
ないなら、そうしたかも
しれないです……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...If there weren't any other
way to pay for my sins, then
I might have done that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280064</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_031&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうならないよう
ちゃんと方法見つけただろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But c'mon, we found a
way to sort it out, so now
you don't have to, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280132</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_032&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わかってるってば</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, &lt;Dio&gt;, I understand that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280312</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……誰が悪いとかいいとか、
人はすぐ決めたがる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Everyone wants to
label other people as
"good" or "evil".</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280312</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_034&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、何が罪で何が正義か、
それを決めるのは
自分の心じゃないかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But the only thing that can really
distinguish between right and
wrong is your own heart, isn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280376</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_035&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>自分の心？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Your own heart?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_036&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>自分が自分の行動を
恥じるか、誇るか……
ってことですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You mean, like...whether
you feel ashamed or proud
of your own actions?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_037&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……かな。
僕はダオスを倒したことを
後悔はしていない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Something like that,
I guess. I don't regret
defeating Dhaos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_038&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも今でも思うんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, I still
think about it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_039&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ダオスは滅ぼうとしていた
自分の故郷の世界樹を
生き返らせるため、戦っていた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dhaos fought to revive
the dying World Tree
of his own homeland.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_040&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>自分の世界を守ろうとした彼を
倒した僕たちこそが、
実は悪だったんじゃないかって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So maybe we, having defeated him
as he fought to protect his own
world, are the truly evil ones.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280880</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_041&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんな……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that's...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281192</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_042&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんなことはないって、
いつも自分に言い聞かせてる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"But that's wrong,"
right? I tell myself
that every time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281192</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_043&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、この世には多くの人がいて、
善悪の基準もその人の数だけある</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But there are many people in this world,
and every single one of them has their
own standard for "right" and "wrong."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281192</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_044&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いまだに僕は
自分のやったことに
答えを出せないでいる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I still can't answer
to myself, for my
own actions...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281192</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_020_045&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それなのに、
『英雄』だなんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And yet, people
call me a "hero"...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
